{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：中国互联网AI模型追踪-性能与价格平衡及多模态亮点</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS在最新一期中国互联网与AI模型追踪报告中，将中国AI模型厂商的年度经常性收入（ARR）合计预期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">100亿美元</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">130亿美元</span>，时间节点为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>底。上调依据来自两方面：国内模型需求高于此前判断，以及智谱API与MiniMax的ARR爬坡速度快于预期。报告同时给出两项具体估算——智谱年底ARR为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25亿美元</span>，MiniMax为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10亿美元</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXiafYqt8qyAn458icibASdH5Q9vBft4kjKeH66JRDoAib5g91LdAThwa0WSUJI9PJibbYScOWCP44kSc7NMu3unoCfriaicpDF8E3EPk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXhBt2EkBPqzjbx4MPjoicyEVvcfIxObKYVribvn1b1gRwicuBdlVKkY9RVZAGefUqmcXD1UbZHb994eIwHlDiak9LzXVc9lDz7Cmg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXK8ZiaNviaB6vUl6AHPLbmZzial79udplNrnOficRzTAsq2RhEk7OicYalUYjLBJzSG4ibDYRib3gEVwoyoOzd0WWarKicUPh6p2KVW08/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/sou